        "translation": "### 3.3 总结：走向统一的数学教育\n\n通过集合、关系、变换等统一概念，通过丰富的教具和动态的教学方法，我们可以让现代数学变得既深刻又有趣。这不仅仅是教学内容的改革，更是对“学习”这一过程本身的深刻重构。\n\n> Through unified concepts like sets and transformations, and through rich aids and dynamic methods, we can make modern mathematics both profound and interesting. This is a profound reconstruction of the process of 'learning' itself."
